    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Start 5 mg PO BID with food (2.5 mg BID if conduction defects or bradycardia could compromise hemodynamics). After two weeks, titrate to a resting HR of 50–60; max 7.5 mg BID. HR < 50 or bradycardia symptoms: ↓ by 2.5 mg BID, and stop if already at 2.5 mg BID."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
