      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Avoid moderate CYP3A4 inhibitors (diltiazem, verapamil, grapefruit juice) and CYP3A4 inducers (St. John's wort, rifampin, barbiturates, phenytoin)."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
